                                "sense_id": "8bd12411-e7e2-3a35-8d6c-69e6c164bbe6",
                                "text": "Prescott's sister calls him a scaredy kitten because he's afraid of the dark."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b8da75c-2a36-4285-8fba-aa6c13e5f742",
                                "sense_id": "8bd12411-e7e2-3a35-8d6c-69e6c164bbe6",
                                "text": "\"Wait, Rufus!\" cried the child. \"Are you afraid of a bunny rabbit? You are such a scaredy dog!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b75fee9-ffed-412d-8a0f-7f8f1cdd9a9f",
                                "sense_id": "8bd12411-e7e2-3a35-8d6c-69e6c164bbe6",
                                "text": "“Yeah! They're scaredy chickens!” Rocko said. “It's scaredy cats, you lunkhead!” Pinball said."
                            }
